# Local branding — copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in.
# Read at build time: re-run `npm run build` after changing it.
# Put the image files in public/brand/ (gitignored too).

# VITE_BRAND_PROJECT=My Project
# VITE_BRAND_COMPANY=My Company
# VITE_BRAND_LOGO=/brand/logo.png
# VITE_BRAND_MARK=/brand/mark.png
# VITE_BRAND_FAVICON=/brand/favicon.png
